---

## CLIN Table

| CLIN | Description | Quantity | Contract Type | Inspection | Packaging | Notes |
|------|-------------|----------|---------------|------------|-----------|-------|
[EXTRACT EVERY SINGLE LINE ITEM/PART FROM ATTACHMENTS (e.g., Parts List). CREATE A CLEAN MARKDOWN TABLE ROW FOR EACH. DO NOT SUMMARIZE. PROHIBITED: "See Attachment", "Various". LIST ALL ITEMS.]

Total Contract Quantity Range:

- Guaranteed Minimum [X]-Year Quantity (GMQ): [Extract or "1"] Units
- Maximum [X]-Year Contract Quantity: [Extract or "Unlimited"] Units

Packaging:

- [Extract or "Commercial Packaging"]
- Preservation: [Extract or "Standard"]
- Quantity per Unit: [Extract or "1"]
- SPI Reference: [Extract or "N/A"]

---

## 🛒 Inspection & Testing

- Inspection Point: [Extract or "Destination"]
- Acceptance Point: [Extract or "Destination"]
- Inspection Agency: [Extract or "Government"]
- Requirement: [Extract or "Standard Inspection"]

Quality Standard: [Extract or "ISO 9001:2015"]
Destructive Testing: [Extract or "No"]

---

## 🛒 Delivery Requirements

### General Delivery Terms

- FOB Point: [Extract or "Destination"]
- Destination: Ship to [Extract exact address. IF MISSING, COPY "AGENCY ISSUING RFQ" ADDRESS FROM OVERVIEW SECTION.]
  - [Full street address]
  - [City], [State] [Zip]
  - [Country]

- Inspection: [Extract or "Destination"]
- Acceptance: [Extract or "Destination"]

### Delivery Schedule

- Production delivery: [Extract or "30 Days ARO"]
- Delivery frequency: [Extract or "One-time"]
- Acceleration: [Extract or "Permitted"]

Definition:
"Days" means [Extract or "Calendar"] days after [Extract or "Award"].

Estimated Overall Duration:
This is a [Extract or "1"]-year contract with [Extract or "0"] option years.

---

## 🛒 Data & Access Requirements

